- Story & Context: Carlos confesses to the silent carriage that he has intentionally loosened the tension springs on the braking system just to hear the way the friction changes the pitch of his track. Standing at the doors near the Central Terminal, he wipes cold grease from his forehead and asks the empty seats: "¿Dónde está el frenado?" before the screeching metal feedback swallows his admission.
